{"q":{"g":"The chemical container can be found in the TerraGroup storage room on Factory, which is located in the underground tunnels right next to the \"Camera Bunker Door\" Scav extraction. A TerraGroup storage room keycard is required to enter it. There are multiple spawns throughout the room.","sh":[{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/8/89/TerraGroup_storage_room_keycard_map.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20240824194327","c":"Room location marked on map"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/f/f1/TerraGroup_storage_room_keycard_door.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20240822192018","c":"Door to the room"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/7/7b/Dragnet_spawn_location_1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20240827225824","c":"First spawn: On the packages to the right after entering"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/4/4f/Dragnet_spawn_location_4.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20240827225838","c":"Second spawn: In the middle compartment of the left industrial shelf"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/0/02/Dragnet_spawn_location_2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20240827225848","c":"Third spawn: On the table"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/a/a7/Dragnet_spawn_location_3.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20240827225858","c":"Fourth spawn: On the shelf to the left after entering"}]},"o":{},"x":{}}